<title>LATVIA: BUDGET SURPLUS 29.55 MLN LATS SO FAR THIS YR.</title>
<headline>BUDGET SURPLUS 29.55 MLN LATS SO FAR THIS YR.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian state budget surplus was running at 29.551 million lats so far this year, made up of income of 232.328 million lats and expenditure of 202.776 million lats, the finance ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cumulative state deficit from January 1 1996 stands at 120.683 million lats, the ministry added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
